Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 02:42:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD review completion confirmation so patch chats close
 only after approval

No-findings reviews append an explicit yes/no state marker to the reviewed patch chat. The controller consumes yes/no answers before normal routing, keeps repeated review cycles observable, and lets the terminal hide confirmed completed chats while reopening them for follow-up text.
